<p>Haha, man, I had not had such a good time on this site since months. On a more serious note though, if you do want to make the mainlist, make that SCP grounded. A <em>lot</em> more grounded. Like rewrite it fully. As Peppers put it, a lot of the cow's effects and abilities just come out of the blue and don't tie together. And it's just way too overpowered to be interesting. Think of ot like playing a game with cheats - you decimate everything, but it's not exactly fun, is it? I'll link you an essay you could use below, as well as the hub for guides and essays. And my final advice: Read. Five thousand SCPs out there, just go through them one by one and you'll get the gist eventually. Never give up. I understand it feels like shit to have your idea that you've put so much effort in just be declined at the first glance, but if you do try harder, you will get somewhere</p>
<p>Anyway, here are the links:<br />
